```console
$ scherzo-cloud invitation --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud invitations

Usage: scherzo-cloud invitation [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list     List your invitation inbox
  preview  Preview an invitation
  accept   Accept an invitation
  decline  Decline an invitation
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
